        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CvCT6EvcxaFg8rd5Dn5wBIM-JTY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235713-whole-chicken-slow-cooker-3x4-step1-3907-7c2538dc0c324d0b8549963c3df981b8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235713/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix salt, paprika, cayenne pepper, onion powder, thyme, white pepper, garlic powder, and black pepper together in a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hOYf3zUaFzUkeHXcQtUi9s2ElsY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235713-whole-chicken-slow-cooker-3x4-step2-3910-c3044be344ff4c659163b47a32202e4b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235713/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rub seasoning mixture over entire chicken to evenly season.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FyJj_GBhw5FvMAY5Z9stv7AM50s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235713-whole-chicken-slow-cooker-3x4-step3-3911-59ceaa587b19491bbf8a4c51cd2fdbc4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235713/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Put rubbed chicken into a large resealable plastic bag; refrigerate, 8 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SyGZBP3XxOy2DF5Gujln93P2lXQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235713-whole-chicken-slow-cooker-3x4-step4-3912-24c593082c3e4aefaca09fedc7edc812.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235713/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove chicken from the bag and cook in a slow cooker on Low until no longer pink at the bone and the juices run clear, 4 to 8 hours. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the thickest part of the thigh, near the bone, should read 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
